     "h": 334,
     "title": "Agile »coraExpress«",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Agile »coraExpress«</h3> <p>»coraExpress« - is an autonomous mobile robot (AMR) that enables automated transportation to the various systems. Alternatively, tools can also be transported using a manual pallet truck.</p> </figcaption>"
